WEX level A (mode 0, host slab) for stock colibri: JustVugg/colibri 561966ec, files c/deepseek_v4.c and
c/Makefile.deepseek-v4. Hooks A1-A11 of docs/COLIBRI-INTEGRATION.md section 5.1, taken from KAIRA 88ddb07, with
three upstream adaptations: the WEX fields other than wex_entries exist only on Windows; v4_read_expert_record
derives layer/expert from the record pointer (upstream V4ExpertRecord has no layer/expert fields); a GGUF record
never matches a container.

Apply from the colibri repo root, after copying the repo's c/*.h c/*.c into c/ (guide section 2):
    git apply --check integration/upstream-561966ec-levelA.patch   (path to this file)
    git apply integration/upstream-561966ec-levelA.patch
Verified 2026-11-08: applies to a clean `git archive 561966ec c`, builds deepseek_v4.exe (MSYS2 UCRT64), and the
CPU engine A/B in guide section 7.5 gives identical tokens for safetensors, WEX1 and WNR2.

